<title>THAILAND: Thailand expresses interest in Omani LNG.</title>
<headline>Thailand expresses interest in Omani LNG.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Industry Minister Korn Dabbaransi hinted on Wednesday that he was more inclined toward buying liquified natural gas (LNG) from Oman although a decision would be officially made in September.</p>
<p>Korn told Reuters that he was still evaluating the  possible purchase and dismissed rumours that the government was set to withdraw from the August 1996 memorandum of understanding to buy LNG from Oman.</p>
</text>
